  "description": "Join us each week as ten-year-old professional stunt girl, Gertrude, her best pal Joansie, and her stunt friends, Zach and Zed fight off the zombie hoard that shut down their movie set and quickly started to invade the rest of the mid-west. This campy thriller will keep you on the edge of your seat, while you try to decide if you should laugh or scream. It has everything you want in a weekly podcast—action, adventure, and a playful sense of world-ending paranoia, mixed with intrigue and topped with a generous sprinkle of elementary humor.",
